ws_run_block 'block-004' 'Creating and pushing SOCI indexes' 'A SOCI index is an artifact that enables lazy loading. It consists of a manifest and zTOCs (table of contents for compressed data). Layers smaller than 10MB are skipped by default since lazy loading provides less benefit for small layers.' 109 118 'bash' '' 600 74 219 <<'WS_TEST_BLOCK_225_004'
